stripe.exe
test-minimax-api.bat
test-minimax-api.py
staging-credentials.txt


.env.scratch
.tmp-*
.env*
# Credential-free templates. Must stay AFTER the .env* catch-all above, or the
# negation has no effect. Never put a real value in a file matched here.
!.env.example
!.env.production.local.example
scratch/

# Claude Code ephemeral worktrees & local backups
.claude/worktrees/
CLAUDE*-BACKUP*.md
# In-flight multi-step checklist (per checkout; see .claude/protocols/session-lifecycle.md)
.claude/state/active-tasks.md
# Pre-launch security blueprints: never commit while the repository is public (checklist F-10)
davintrade-pre-launch-security-check-lists/
docs/runbooks/pre-launch-security-checklist.md
# Security audit notes and their handoffs: kept out of the public repository
davintrade-cloudflare-security-audit/
docs/handoffs/2026-11-01-sec-audit-cloudflare-hardening-*.md
# Security monitoring pipeline blueprint, reviews and scan reports: they can hold unfixed findings
davintrade-security-monitoring-pipeline/
# davintrade.com marketing workspace (raw ~560 MB media, Harness legal/review notes, and isolated web/ private repo):
# kept strictly out of the public trading-alerts-saas-public repository
/davintrade-dot-com/
# Syncthing conflict copies: they can hold copies of ignored files such as .env, so never track them
*.sync-conflict-*

# Compiled MQL5 build output in the new trendline-context architecture folder (source only is
# tracked there; .ex5 binaries are MetaEditor's local compile output, both Davin's and the
# Executor's, and were accumulating untracked -- flagged in chat 2026-11-14, addressed here).
# Scoped to this one folder, not repo-wide: other mql5-indicators/ folders track .ex5 on purpose.
backend-stack-c/1_EA-and-backfill-worker-on-contabo-vps/v2_29_data_pipeline_architecture/mq5/new-market-context-synthesis-and-analysis-architecture/*.ex5
